---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';
import { submitLead } from '../lib/leads';
import { env } from 'cloudflare:workers';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { serviceNode } from '../lib/schema';
const result = Astro.request.method === 'POST' ? await submitLead(Astro.request, env) : null;
if (result) Astro.response.status = result.status;
Astro.response.headers.set('Cache-Control', 'no-store');
const pageSchema = serviceNode('/free-hail-inspection/','Free Initial Assessment','A no-obligation initial conversation and visual assessment for vehicle hail damage, dents, and Paintless Dent Repair suitability.');
---
<Layout title="Free Initial Assessment | Peak Country" description="Start with a free, no-obligation conversation about hail damage, dents, Paintless Dent Repair, and the right next step." exactTitle pageSchema={pageSchema}>
  <header class="page-head assessment-head"><div class="eyebrow">Recommended starting point · $0</div><h1>Free Initial Assessment</h1><p>Start with a conversation—not a commitment. We’ll help you understand the damage, whether PDR may be appropriate, and what next step makes sense.</p><div class="about-actions"><a class="button" href="#request">Get Started →</a><a class="text-link" href="/estimating-documentation/">When detailed documentation is needed →</a></div></header>
  <section class="section assessment-intro">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">No surprise charges</div><h2>What is a Free Initial Assessment?</h2><p class="direct-answer">A Free Initial Assessment is the first no-obligation conversation about the vehicle, visible damage, photos when useful, and the most appropriate next step. It does not automatically include a physical panel-by-panel hail inspection or written estimate.</p><p>There is no charge, obligation, repair authorization, or automatic checkout for submitting a request, sending photos, speaking with Peak Country, or requesting an assessment.</p><p>For minor or localized damage, verbal guidance or a price range may be available when it can reasonably be evaluated. A Free Initial Assessment does not automatically become a formal written estimate, insurance estimate, itemized repair document, detailed hail inspection, or guaranteed final price.</p></div>
    <aside><strong>What we can discuss</strong><ul><li>Visible damage and your concerns</li><li>Whether PDR appears appropriate</li><li>Factors that may affect repair</li><li>Repair options and next steps</li><li>Whether detailed documentation would help</li></ul></aside>
  </section>
  <section class="section assessment-hail"><div><div class="eyebrow">Hail needs a closer look</div><h2>What is a professional hail inspection?</h2></div><div><p class="direct-answer">A professional hail inspection is a direct review of a clean vehicle under appropriate PDR lighting, with panels checked for dent patterns, paint condition, repairability, access, and possible disassembly needs. It is a separate next step when the initial conversation indicates that closer evaluation is appropriate.</p><p>Hail damage can be difficult to see and may require panel-by-panel inspection and dent counts. The initial assessment helps determine the apparent extent of the damage and what type of evaluation is appropriate next.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section assessment-documentation"><div><div class="eyebrow">Professional documentation</div><h2>When more detailed documentation is needed.</h2><p>Some repairs require formal repair planning, technical research, or written documentation. Those professional services are explained with their price before anything paid begins.</p><a class="text-link" href="/estimating-documentation/">Explore Professional Estimating &amp; Documentation →</a></div><nav aria-label="Related repair resources"><a href="/faq/#insurance-questions">Insurance FAQ →</a><a href="/repair-standards/">Repair Evaluation →</a><a href="/auto-hail-repair/">Hail Repair →</a><a href="/paintless-dent-repair/">PDR →</a></nav></section>
  <section id="request" class="section narrow assessment-request">
    <div class="contact-direct"><p class="eyebrow">Call, text, or request online</p><h2><a href={`tel:${site.phone}`}>Call {site.phoneDisplay}</a></h2><p><a href={`sms:${site.phone}`}>Text Peak Country</a> or send a no-obligation request below. Contacting us does not create a charge or authorize repair.</p></div>
    {result && <div role="status" class={result.ok ? 'success' : 'error'}>{result.message}{!result.ok && <p>For your privacy, form entries are not retained on this page. Re-enter them before trying again.</p>}</div>}
    {!result?.ok && <LeadForm source="/free-hail-inspection/" />}
  </section>
</Layout>
